<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-COPA CENTENARIO RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COPA CENTENARIO RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BELO HORIZONTE, Brazil 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atletico Mineiro (Brazil) and Milan (Italy) drew 2-2 (halftime 0-2) in a Copa Centenario group A match Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Atletico Mineiro - Jorginho (70), Ernani (83)</p>
<p>Milan - George Weah (16,31)</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,790</p>
<p>Group A standings</p>
<p> Atletico Mineiro				 1  0  1  0  2  2  1</p>
<p> Milan						1  0  1  0  2  2 1</p>
<p>America-Belo Horizonte (Brazil)	     1  0  1  0  1  1  1</p>
<p> Corinthians (Brazil)			  1  0  1  0  1  1  1</p>
<p>Winners meet group B winners in final on August 9.</p>
</text>
